# web-server

- FastAPI: `GET /networks`, `GET /networks/{id}/topology`, `GET /events`, `POST /powerflow`, `GET /simulator`, `POST /simulator/start|stop`, `WS /ws/telemetry`.
- Own venv; editable `../packages/gridpulse`. Tail `events.jsonl` → WS fanout; supervise `gridpulse-simulate` as a subprocess (never embed the sim loop in-process).
- Topology/layout comes from `PNetwork` / `layout_network`; keep CORS open for local Vite.
